# Helm
charts/
Chart.lock
*.tgz

# EXCEPT the Rook chart locks — committed on purpose so the deployed subchart
# version is pinned + reviewable in git (the 2026-06-12 CSI outage came from an
# unreviewed Chart.yaml bump; see CLAUDE.md "Upgrading Rook/Ceph"). A supervised
# Rook bump updates both of these in the same commit as the Chart.yaml change.
!components/operators/rook-ceph/Chart.lock
!components/storage/rook-ceph-cluster/Chart.lock

# AND the nfs-csi lock — same reasoning as Rook. Found drifted 2026-08-25:
# Chart.yaml asked for 4.13.4 while the vendored tgz + lock were 4.11.0, so a
# local `helm template` rendered 4.11.0 while ArgoCD deployed 4.13.4 (live
# nfsplugin:v4.13.4 confirmed). Harmless that time, but it means any local diff
# review of this chart was reviewing fiction — unacceptable now that media +
# immich are about to depend on it.
!components/storage/nfs-csi/Chart.lock

# AND the sealed-secrets chart is VENDORED (tgz + lock committed) so a fresh
# bootstrap never depends on a remote Helm repo — it's bootstrap-critical (it
# decrypts the Cloudflare token) and the old chart repo URL 404'd after the
# Bitnami overhaul. Re-include the dir first, then the tgz + lock.
!components/operators/sealed-secrets/charts/
!components/operators/sealed-secrets/charts/sealed-secrets-*.tgz
!components/operators/sealed-secrets/Chart.lock

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code exports
*.txt
!data/**/*.txt

# Claude Code local session state
.claude/

# Kubeconfigs — canonical location is ~/.kube/, never the repo. This is
# defense-in-depth in case one ever lands here by accident.
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
config-breakglass
config-readonly
.bench-podlogs/
